{"authored" [{"question" "q-5046" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The function $f(x)$ is defined below. What is the value of \n${\\int }_{-3}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x?$\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}4, & x<0 \\\\ -x+4, & x\\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010574/state.json" "file_sha256" "b19b19cff5d511839d0ad8399e234f3685ea81e54dd140d297072353c5c11f55" "basis" 1151 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010574/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-5046" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "By the additive property of the definite integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-3}^{0}4\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{4}(-x+4)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4x{|}_{-3}^{0}+(-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+4x){|}_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =[4(0)-4(-3)]+[-\\frac{(4)^{2}}{2}+4(4)+\\frac{(0)^{2}}{2}-4(0)] \\\\  & =[0+12]+[-8+16+0-0] \\\\  & =12+8 \\\\  & =20.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010574/state.json" "file_sha256" "b19b19cff5d511839d0ad8399e234f3685ea81e54dd140d297072353c5c11f55" "basis" 1151 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010574/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-5046" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010574/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8ddb95531a97f38217f742fcfc2b96f34ca54152b25c7ff23e8ac70cfc220ca1" "basis" 1151 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010574/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-5046" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-